        "original_id": "1e202dac-626f-557c-8660-38cada907ec1",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: The Shops at Wisconsin Place, Chevy Chase, Maryland\n- Projects: Wisconsin Place complex\n- Companies: Woodward & Lothrop, Hecht's, Bloomingdale's, Whole Foods Market, Talbots, Chatherines, Lane Bryant, Evans, Ulla Popken, Just My Size\n- People: Angellika Morton\n- Topics: Retail, fashion, shopping centers\n\nFacts:\n- The Shops at Wisconsin Place is an open-air shopping center in Chevy Chase, Maryland, and it is part of the mixed-use Wisconsin Place complex.\n- The Shops at Wisconsin Place is located on the site of a former Woodward & Lothrop department store.\n- Hecht's converted the former Woodward & Lothrop department store in 1995 and closed the store in 2005.\n- Bloomingdale's opened Maryland's second Bloomingdale's at The Shops at Wisconsin Place on September 27, 2007.\n- Whole Foods Market opened at The Shops at Wisconsin Place on May 18, 2010.\n- Talbots is an American specialty retailer and direct marketer of women's clothing, shoes, and fashion accessories.\n- Angellika Morton has done photo shoots for Talbots, Chatherines, Lane Bryant, Evans, Ulla Popken, and Just My Size.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
